{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05769","headline":"奉和张使君宴加朝散 · 卢象","name":"奉和张使君宴加朝散","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佐理星辰贵，分荣涣汗深。\n言从大夫後，用荅圣人心。\n骑拥轩裳客，鸾惊翰墨林。\n停杯歌麦秀，秉烛醉棠阴。\n爽气凌秋笛，轻寒散暝砧。\n秪应将四子，讲德谢知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}